# Migration Overview

Webflow → Astro + Sanity on Cloudflare. Status as at 2026-11-17.

## 1. Reconnaissance

- [x] URL inventory reconciled — 23 paths = 18 static + 5 CMS templates
- [x] Shell identified (nav + footer punched out to `<!--wf:nav-->` / `<!--wf:footer-->`)
- [x] Forms confirmed third-party (jotform, usebasin, zapier, carepatron) — survive cut-over
- [x] No password-protected pages on this site
- [ ] POAC page missed in the inventory — never ported

## 2. Scaffold

- [x] `web/` + `studio/` + root orchestration
- [x] `project.jsonc` as sole config source, readers in all three runtimes
- [x] Both Wrangler configs
- [x] `.assetsignore` shipped
- [x] All four root commands exist with working targets
- [x] Production deploy guards in place

## 3. Static pages

- [x] 18 pages extracted and ported verbatim
- [x] Structural verifier written (`npm run verify`)
- [x] Titles stored decoded, escaped once on output
- [x] 404 page guarded against middleware substitution

## 4. CMS

- [x] Collections discovered and field schemas dumped
- [x] Raw pull committed to `migration/raw/`
- [x] Converter written, deterministic keys, fixtures in place
- [x] 11 document types converted — 299 documents
- [x] Dataset imported and verified against raw dump
- [x] References pruned against live id set

## 5. Assets

- [x] CSS/JS bundles fetched
- [x] All assets localised — 115 files in `dist/wf/assets`
- [x] Fonts local
- [x] `assets:check` passes — site does not need the Webflow account

## 6. CMS routes

- [x] `/services/[slug]`
- [x] `/category/[slug]`
- [x] `/post/[slug]`
- [x] `/reviews/[slug]`
- [x] `/team/[slug]`
- [x] Images bound per item, not per sample
- [x] Portable Text rendered into `.w-richtext`
- [ ] `/poac` route — 14 documents in Sanity, no page renders them *(in progress — PM)*

## 7. Sitemap, robots, redirects

- [x] Sitemap generated from the same sources the routes use
- [x] `/404` excluded
- [x] `lastmod` only on CMS documents
- [x] Redirects single-sourced from `redirects.config.mjs`
- [ ] Redirect `/services/3d4d` → `/3d4d` added but **not yet deployed** (live returns 404)

## 8. Cut over

- [x] Deploy dry-run validated
- [x] DNS confirmed Cloudflare-side
- [x] Reviewed on `*.workers.dev`
- [x] Route attached — production live
- [x] Studio deployed (`lux-radiology`)
- [ ] Studio desk clicked through by a human

## 9. Gates

- [x] `npm run verify` — structure
- [x] `npm test` — converter loses no visible character
- [x] `npm run sanity:verify` — dataset matches raw dump
- [x] `npm run assets:check` — no Webflow dependency
- [x] `npm run check` — 0 errors, 0 warnings, 0 hints
- [ ] `npm run sitemap` — now compares against our own deployed site, so no longer a live-vs-port check

## 10. Open

- [ ] **Routes are fully prerendered — no route sets `prerender = false`.** CMS edits do not appear until a rebuild and redeploy
- [ ] `/poac` page *(in progress — PM)*
- [ ] Deploy pending: 3D4D link fix + its redirect are in Sanity and config but not in the live build
- [ ] `schema/index.mjs` absent from the scaffold
- [ ] Studio desk not yet walked by hand
- [ ] Google Fonts still external (known, survives cut-over)
- [ ] Webflow JS runtime shipped as-is (known, replacing it is a redesign)
- [ ] Static-page prose stays in HTML — not editable without a deploy
